msgid "Description"
msgstr "Popis"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/boxblur.rst:41
msgid ""
"This effect blurs the image based on the horizontal and vertical "
"multiplicator allowing uneven blurring or blurring in only one direction. "
"Not be confused with the deprecated Box Blur effect."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt rozostrie obraz na základe horizontálneho a vertikálneho "
"multiplikátora, čo umožňuje nerovnomerné rozostrenie alebo rozostrenie len v "
"jednom smere. Nezamieňajte s nepoužívaným efektom Box Blur."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/boxblur.rst:45
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parametre"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/boxblur.rst:52
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "Parameter"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/boxblur.rst:53
msgid "Value"
msgstr "Hodnota"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/boxblur.rst:55
msgid "Preserve alpha"
msgstr "Zachovávať alfa"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/boxblur.rst:56
msgid "Checkbox"
msgstr "Zaškrtávacie tlačidlo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/boxblur.rst:57
msgid "If checked, the alpha channel will not be blurred"
msgstr "Ak je zaškrtnuté, alfa kanál nebude rozostrený"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/boxblur.rst:58
msgid "Horizontal multiplicator"
msgstr "Horizontálny multiplikátor"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/boxblur.rst:59
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/boxblur.rst:62
msgid "Percentage"
msgstr "Percento"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/boxblur.rst:60
msgid ""
"Sets the amount of horizontal blur. Range is from 0% to 1000%, default is 1%."
msgstr ""
"Nastaví množstvo horizontálneho rozostrenia. Rozsah je od 0 % do 1000 %, "
"predvolená hodnota je 1 %."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/boxblur.rst:61
msgid "Vertical multiplicator"
msgstr "Vertikálny multiplikátor"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/boxblur.rst:63
msgid ""
"Sets the amount of vertical blur. Range is from 0% to 1000%, default is 1%."
msgstr ""
"Nastaví množstvo vertikálneho rozostrenia. Rozsah je od 0 % do 1000 %, "
"predvolená hodnota je 1 %."

